&lt;h1&gt;Visitor Re-Check-In Notification&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="body"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Host,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would like to inform you that the following visitor has successfully re-checked in for their scheduled visit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visitor Name:&lt;/strong&gt; ${visitor.full_name}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re-Check-In Date:&lt;/strong&gt; ${start_date}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; ${start_time}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; ${location.name}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visit Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; ${visit_duration}                                                                           ${visitor.company}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please ensure you are available to assist your visitor as needed. If there are any changes or additional instructions, feel free to inform the visitor or our front desk team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your attention to this matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
